This repository contains an excerpt of a book in preparation (cover, table of contents
and preface) and an overview of the book. The text, figures and cover may be
read and linked to. They may not be reproduced, redistributed or modified, in whole or in
part, without the written permission of the author, apart from short quotations with
attribution.

The cover art is made from public data of the Virgo simulation (Virgo Consortium). Data and
figures of other authors shown in the excerpt keep the terms of their original publications.

The research papers, data and code that the book is built on are released in separate
repositories under their own licences (see README.md).
